#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:21 61dd2eb1c9694ceca6703539fbed3641
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectAmplify is a basic gain control effect that increases or decreases the volume of "
"the audio signal. It provides both decibel (dB) and linear control over the amplification level."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectAmplify**    会在总线效果链中创建一个增益 DSP。它适合做总线音量微调、临时放大或衰减，也可以在运行时用    ``volume_db``    "
"或    ``volume_linear``    做平滑的强度控制。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:23 182f1b5a03f743c4862145f15595e252
msgid ""
"Use this effect for simple volume adjustments, boosting quiet signals, or attenuating loud "
"signals in your audio pipeline."
msgstr "用于调整音量、放大较弱的信号或衰减过强的信号。"

