#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectamplify.rst:94 49dd86a3d2d445258c5c23c910c77cca
msgid ""
"The amplification level as a linear value. A value of 1.0 is unity gain. The setter floors values"
" at 0.001 before converting to :ref:`volume_db<class_FmodAudioEffectAmplify_property_volume_db>`;"
" inputs at or below this floor map to -60 dB. The getter returns 0.0 for stored gains at or below"
" -60 dB, so setting 0.0 produces silence. The maximum stored gain of +24 dB corresponds to "
"approximately 15.8489."
msgstr ""
"线性增益，1.0 为单位增益。设置时先将数值下限限制为 0.001，再转换为 "
":ref:`volume_db<class_FmodAudioEffectAmplify_property_volume_db>`；小于或等于该下限的输入映射到 -60 dB。存储增益小于或等于"
" -60 dB 时，读取返回 0.0，因此设置 0.0 会静音。最大存储增益 +24 dB 对应约 15.8489。"

